Fair value starts at 10.5, the expected sum of three dice. Someone sold to us at 9.2, which hints slightly at a lower settlement, so I estimate fair value at about 10.3.

I keep a spread of roughly ±1.3 to protect against informed traders. I also shade both sides down a little because I am already long one unit.

